 },
 "publishedAt": "2026-03-20T12:27:56Z",
 "excerpt": "When owners hesitate between geothermal (ground-to-water) and an air-source heat pump (air-to-water), they often compare the installation price first. For a property investment, though, only the total cost of ownership over 25 years matters.",
 "category": "geothermie",
 "author": "WellDoneDrill",
 "readingTime": 4,
 "featured": false,
 "body": [
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "d8a4afd6894c",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7777a86c9e69",
     "text": "When owners hesitate between geothermal (ground-to-water) and an air-source heat pump (air-to-water), their first reflex is often to compare the upfront installation price. For a property investment, however, the only relevant view is the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e94bef2d397d",
     "text": "total cost of ownership (TCO)",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "306e8123617b",
     "text": " over 25 years. At ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "99fddb3f82d0",
     "text": "WellDoneDrill",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f5edf631eb31",
     "text": ", we have analysed the figures. Here is why geothermal wins the economic match over time.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "7733b2667586",
   "style": "h3",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2c532cac5342",
     "text": "1. The initial investment: the borehole is an asset, not an expense",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0f848cd6b37b",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e62b225b04d3",
     "text": "It is true that a geothermal heat pump costs more at the start, mainly because of the 150-metre borehole.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "6b2dbd016c13",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "3e57119931ed",
     "text": "Air-to-water heat pump:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c45e0c29863c",
     "text": " About €12,000 to €18,000.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "7d2629d8661e",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fe15dabec4d1",
     "text": "Geothermal:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ed847bde4a21",
     "text": " About €25,000 to €35,000 (depending on the borehole). But there is a major difference: the outdoor unit of an air-to-water heat pump is a machine that wears out, while the borehole drilled by WellDoneDrill is ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "cd6943c759c6",
     "text": "property infrastructure",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9e2090f830b3",
     "text": " that lasts more than 50 years.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e3cb9de3c75c",
   "style": "h3",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c5fb7ad7b07e",
     "text": "2. Electricity consumption: the weight of the SCOP",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "1355407c6cc9",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "855ede5f9aad",
     "text": "The efficiency of an air-to-water heat pump drops when it is cold outside (exactly when you need it most). Geothermal, by contrast, draws on a source at a constant 12 °C.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "91cedfe37a5d",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c2b67c699a59",
     "text": "Air-to-water heat pump:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0ad553028d73",
     "text": " Seasonal COP (SCOP) of about 3 to 3.5.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "225ca7282f7f",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2435a545b05c",
     "text": "Geothermal:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "be5fce7fd939",
     "text": " SCOP of about 4.5 to 5.5. Over 25 years, for an average house, geothermal uses around ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2f39f0a4dc35",
     "text": "30 % to 40 % less electricity",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "83dd8a1ed814",
     "text": ". With energy prices expected to rise, this saving adds up to tens of thousands of euros over two decades.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "76f51a5c76ca",
   "style": "h3",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d2d3dc00130d",
     "text": "3. Lifespan and equipment replacement",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e26706c3b73f",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7c6a5307d665",
     "text": "This is where the difference becomes striking.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "b405f74581ce",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "743ff18574f5",
     "text": "Air-to-water heat pump:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8a0c321387c0",
     "text": " Exposed to the weather, frost and intensive defrost cycles, it lasts ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c56c96058d45",
     "text": "12 to 15 years",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fd5a680e7cd0",
     "text": " on average. Over 25 years, you will have to replace it ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9d977f0f2faf",
     "text": "twice",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a0487ae26108",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "3348c6d8aed0",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "3cce982947b6",
     "text": "Geothermal:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a2fede9be0ef",
     "text": " The heat pump sits indoors, in a dry and stable environment. It works less hard because the source is constant. It lasts ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5c3627cf23af",
     "text": "20 to 25 years",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8073104a6a2e",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "878e791393c2",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "935900eb7e7e",
     "text": "The borehole:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0ea257d5d37a",
     "text": " It is never replaced. In 25 years, if you change the machine, you simply reconnect to your existing probes.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "189892897d8a",
   "style": "h3",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "75a9afd3d286",
     "text": "4. Maintenance and repair costs",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f40a4d6cb0a3",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "575860a9b5df",
     "text": "An outdoor unit (air-to-water) needs regular fin cleaning, suffers from corrosion and has exposed moving parts (the fan). Geothermal is a sealed, passive circuit underground with a simple machine in the basement. Repair costs are statistically much lower for ground-source systems.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "2ebbe4b319ee",
   "style": "h3",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ac5294cfe10f",
     "text": "5. Geocooling: free air conditioning",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f5eb9f25f73e",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8afc04128cd4",
     "text": "In summer, an air-to-water heat pump has to reverse its cycle to cool, which uses a lot of electricity. Geothermal uses ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "84389b41bd8d",
     "text": "passive geocooling",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "58b2dff18dc5",
     "text": " (only a small 50 W circulator runs). Over 25 summers, cooling comfort is almost free with geothermal, while it is expensive with an air-source system.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "729aad75dd14",
   "style": "h3",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0c2235a831d6",
     "text": "25-year balance (estimate for a 200 m² house)",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": []
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "d85b59f59607",
   "style": "normal",
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b20442131ecc",
     "text": "Initial installation:",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "bacbf22c4637",
     "text": " Air-to-water €15,000 · Geothermal (machine + borehole) €30,000",
